:: OC Noah Science Basic [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang</span> separates the entire class into pairs of two and gives each of you a worksheet to practice the various scientific formulas he’s been going over with the class recently. You get paired with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>, the boy you meet in swimming class. <span style="color:LightGreen">He smiles and greets you as he sits down.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>, how are you?”</span> He asks, pulling out his worksheet. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I actually was going over these formulas last night, so it should be pretty easy. Here, let me show you-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> manages to explain things better than <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang</span> even, helping you with anything you might be struggling with. When you ask him how he’s so smart, he laughs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Trust me, it’s not natural. I just study a lot. I kind of have to. Preston is very strict, so if I don’t keep my grades up, I won’t be able to be swimming team captain. So, it’s worth the extra effort.”</span> <span style="color:lightgreen">He smiles as the two of you continue working on the questions, getting them done with a lot of time to spare.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "NoahH" 3 1>>
<<skillPoints "Science" 3>>
<br>
<<include"Attend Science Finish">>